# Fellowship Management System - Environment Configuration

## Backend (.env for backend/)

```env
# Database
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/fellowship?schema=public"

# Authentication
JWT_SECRET="change-this-to-a-very-long-random-string-min-64-chars"
JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRES_IN="15m"
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN="7d"
BCRYPT_ROUNDS=12

# Server
PORT=3000
NODE_ENV=development
FRONTEND_URL="http://localhost:5173"

# Rate Limiting (Redis)
REDIS_URL="redis://localhost:6379"
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX=100

# File Upload
UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE=10485760
UPLOAD_DIR="./uploads"
ALLOWED_FILE_TYPES="jpg,jpeg,png,gif,pdf,doc,docx,xls,xlsx,txt"

# Backup
BACKUP_INTERVAL_HOURS=12
BACKUP_DIR="./backups"
BACKUP_CLOUD_ENABLED=false
BACKUP_CLOUD_PROVIDER="" # s3 or gcs
BACKUP_CLOUD_BUCKET=""
BACKUP_CLOUD_ENDPOINT=""
BACKUP_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY=""
BACKUP_CLOUD_SECRET_KEY=""
BACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=30 # Recycle bin; backups are indefinite
```

## Frontend (.env for frontend/)

```env
VITE_API_BASE_URL="http://localhost:3000/api/v1"

# PWA
VITE_APP_NAME="Fellowship Manager"
VITE_APP_SHORT_NAME="Fellowship"
VITE_APP_DESCRIPTION="Fellowship Management System"
VITE_APP_THEME_COLOR="#2563eb"
VITE_APP_BACKGROUND_COLOR="#ffffff"
```
